WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
From finding artwork to AI processing, image preparation and layout, MAIXON eight point six brings prepress into one workspace.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Halftone adjusts the dot pattern. DTF offers single artwork, repeated layouts, multiple-image layouts and custom canvases. Choose the mode for your production task.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.000
DTG controls fabric and white ink separately. For sublimation, compare layouts, review the result and export.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Connect tasks with instructions and switch themes whenever you need.
